<title>USA: US Mint buys 50,000 kg nickel at avg $7.1717/kg.</title>
<headline>US Mint buys 50,000 kg nickel at avg $7.1717/kg.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Mint said Wednesday that it bought 50,000 kg of surplus nickel in two lots from Hochschild Partners at an average price of $7.1717 per kg.</p>
<p>The total purchase price of the nickel was $358,585.00, the Mint said.</p>
